<!DOCTYPE html>
<head>

    <title>Daily News</title>

    <style>
        * {
            margin: 0;
            padding: 0;
            box-sizing: border-box;
        }

        body {
            font-family: Georgia, "Times New Roman", serif;
            background-color: #c47373;
            color: #222;
        }

        header {
            background-color: #90619c;
            color: white;
            text-align: center;
            padding: 20px;
        }

        header h1 {
            font-size: 42px;
            letter-spacing: 2px;
        }

        header p {
            margin-top: 8px;
            font-size: 14px;
        }

        nav {
            background-color: #9e4987;
            padding: 12px;
            text-align: center;
        }

        nav a {
            color: white;
            text-decoration: none;
            margin: 0 18px;
            font-family: Arial, sans-serif;
            font-weight: bold;
        }

        nav a:hover {
            text-decoration: underline;
        }

        .newspaper {
            max-width: 1200px;
            margin: 30px auto;
            padding: 20px;

            display: grid;
            grid-template-columns: 1fr 2fr 1fr;
            gap: 25px;
        }

        .column {
            background-color: rgb(174, 152, 209);
            padding: 20px;
        }

        .main-news {
            grid-column: 2;
        }

        .main-news h2 {
            font-size: 34px;
            line-height: 1.2;
            margin-bottom: 15px;
        }

        .main-news img {
            width: 100%;
            height: 230px;
            object-fit: cover;
            margin-bottom: 15px;
        }

        article {
            border-bottom: 5px solid #ccc;
            padding-bottom: 20px;
            margin-bottom: 20px;
        }

        article h3 {
            font-size: 20px;
            margin-bottom: 10px;
        }

        article p {
            font-size: 15px;
            line-height: 1.6;
        }

        .side-news h2 {
            font-size: 24px;
            border-bottom: 3px solid #111;
            padding-bottom: 10px;
            margin-bottom: 15px;
        }

        .side-news article h3 {
            font-size: 20px;
        }

        .image-placeholder {
            height: 130px;
            background-color: #ddd;
            display: flex;
            justify-content: center;
            align-items: center;
            margin-bottom: 12px;
            color: #666;
            font-family: Arial, sans-serif;
        }

        footer {
            background-color: #111;
            color: white;
            text-align: center;
            padding: 20px;
            font-family: Arial, sans-serif;
        }

        @media (max-width: 800px) {

            .newspaper {
                grid-template-columns: 1fr;
            }

            .main-news {
                grid-column: auto;
            }

            header h1 {
                font-size: 32px;
            }

            nav a {
                display: inline-block;
                margin: 5px 8px;
            }
        }
    </style>
</head>

<body>

    <header>
        <h1>THE DAILY NEWS</h1>
        <p>Truth • Facts • Latest Updates</p>
    </header>


    <nav>
        <a href="#">Home</a>
        <a href="#">National</a>
        <a href="#">World</a>
        <a href="#">Technology</a>
        <a href="#">Sports</a>
    </nav>


    <main class="newspaper">

        <section class="column">

            <article>
                <div class="image-placeholder">
                    Image
                </div>

                <h3>New Technology Changing the World</h3>

                <p>
                    New technologies are transforming the way
                    people work, communicate and learn.
                </p>
            </article>

            <article>
                <h3>Education Gets a Digital Boost</h3>

                <p>
                    Schools and colleges are increasingly adopting
                    digital tools to improve learning.
                </p>
            </article>

        </section>


        <section class="column main-news">

            <h2>
                Technology and Innovation Shape the Future
            </h2>

            <div class="image-placeholder">
                Main News Image
            </div>

            <p>
                Technology continues to play an important role
                in modern society. From artificial intelligence
                to renewable energy, new innovations are changing
                industries around the world.
            </p>

            <br>

            <article>
                <h3>Artificial Intelligence Expands</h3>

                <p>
                    Artificial intelligence is being used in
                    education, healthcare, business and many
                    other fields.
                </p>
            </article>

            <article>
                <h3>Innovation Creates New Opportunities</h3>

                <p>
                    Young developers and entrepreneurs are using
                    technology to solve real-world problems.
                </p>
            </article>

        </section>


        <aside class="column side-news">

            <h2>Latest News</h2>

            <article>
                <h3>Sports Update</h3>

                <p>
                    Major sporting events attract millions
                    of viewers around the world.
                </p>
            </article>

            <article>
                <h3>Weather Report</h3>

                <p>
                    Weather departments have issued updates
                    for several regions.
                </p>
            </article>

            <article>
                <h3>Business News</h3>

                <p>
                    Markets continue to respond to new
                    economic developments.
                </p>
            </article>

            <article>
                <h3>World News</h3>

                <p>
                    Important developments are being reported
                    from different parts of the world.
                </p>
            </article>

        </aside>

    </main>


    <footer>
        <p>©️ 2026 The Daily News | All Rights Reserved</p>
    </footer>

</body>
</html>
